    "description": "Run DeepSeek Harness on Android — a layered runtime (Debian + Node.js + DSH) inside a rootless PRoot sandbox, with an embedded WebView UI, file manager, persistent terminal, and one-tap runtime/DSH updates. Install the APK and go."
